  "holistic_F_N": 0,
  "holistic_F_H": -1,
  "section_notes": "S1 imposes strict incident reporting (24h to regulator, 30-day investigation, customer notice within 24h/5 business days) with annual reconciliation. S2 sets a 55°C test and 5% failure limit with no phase-in, sales stop until retest/regulator approval, and per-model results to customers but no public per-model publication. S3 requires new-unit remote shut-off from adoption and installed-unit retrofit within 6 years; S4 requires built-in fire suppression at 36 months; S5 mandates recall at 8/100k with prompt notices and no transition or serious-injury clause."
 },
